{"lines":[{"h":0.018918419641161699,"text":"His Son whom He has sent into the world that in Him we","conf":1,"x":0.10926367501533897,"y":0.9404069774424294,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"conf":1,"x":0.10688835013455583,"w":0.73634204616794352,"h":0.021860003471374512,"text":"may apprehend the full manifestation of divine love.","y":0.91418650782366251},{"y":0.89087301554964615,"text":"\"Behold, I stand at the door and knock.\" Once more in","x":0.13776725023598857,"w":0.79334912981305794,"conf":1,"h":0.023371170437525124},{"x":0.10926368239855327,"text":"the season of Advent the summoning message rings out,","conf":1,"y":0.86918604674154243,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.021802325097341479},{"x":0.10926365332461453,"w":0.81947742808948865,"y":0.84593023307269555,"h":0.021877306794363394,"text":"admonishing us to look with concentrated gaze on Him who","conf":1},{"text":"is the very image of divine love, and who is also in conse-","y":0.82266865052639837,"conf":1,"w":0.82422801426478798,"x":0.10688837503308496,"h":0.021825396825396859},{"w":0.81947742808948854,"text":"quence-and the second Sunday in Advent teaches us to","y":0.80084325393391809,"h":0.02037767569224036,"x":0.10926366246950753,"conf":1},{"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"text":"think of this—the Judge of the whole world. For so it is:","h":0.020400747420295851,"x":0.10926365539875761,"y":0.77901785681653535},{"text":"the depths of divine love are opened out only to him who","conf":1,"x":0.10688836836450777,"y":0.75570436549741171,"h":0.020458424848223467,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"x":0.10926366092980609,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020452657389262385,"conf":1,"text":"allows himself to be emancipated from his attachment to the","y":0.73401162811366716},{"x":0.10926365539875761,"conf":1,"y":0.71075581426399936,"text":"things of time and space and who allows Christ to effect this","w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.020394979015229353},{"text":"redemptive work of emancipation in his life. May we prepare","w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021825396825396748,"conf":1,"y":0.68750000029393732,"x":0.10926366710557797},{"h":0.020371908233279168,"y":0.66567460295953196,"conf":1,"text":"and dispose our hearts for this work of divine redemption!","w":0.78859854363775872,"x":0.10926366791644472},{"h":0.025611913393414176,"y":0.63292233121506347,"x":0.10650841418547399,"w":0.63729749407087055,"conf":1,"text":"\"Bewildered I stood in the world of my night."},{"w":0.68883608533190444,"conf":1,"text":"Yet Thou comest! Because I exist, Thou art born.","h":0.021900377576313357,"y":0.61036706376959571,"x":0.15914490573072226},{"text":"From error and gloom set my face to the light","y":0.58854166680534847,"h":0.021923449304368736,"w":0.63420427000367796,"conf":1,"x":0.12589074363745512},{"conf":1,"text":"Of Thyself, Word incarnate, Thou Lord of the morn!\"1","y":0.56395348818818458,"w":0.77672205342874912,"h":0.024709302281576528,"x":0.1567696147147625},{"conf":1,"x":0.42280285629383141,"y":0.54067460338473761,"w":0.19002374426111002,"h":0.016121031746031855,"text":"1 R. A. Schröder."},{"h":0.015988372621082103,"conf":1,"w":0.049881235345617558,"text":"142","x":0.48931116421555226,"y":0.074127906797501586}],"page":138,"w":7029,"h":11508}